31">so </span><span begin="00:16.437" end="00:17.261">low </span><span begin="00:17.438" end="00:17.669">and </span><span begin="00:17.669" end="00:17.830">lose </span><span begin="00:17.830" end="00:18.278">all </span><span begin="00:18.278" end="00:20.485">control</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.534" end="00:28.758"><span begin="00:24.534" end="00:24.774">So </span><span begin="00:24.774" end="00:25.318">hold </span><span begin="00:25.318" end="00:25.973">me </span><span begin="00:25.973" end="00:26.541">close </span><span begin="00:26.822" end="00:27.045">I </span><span begin="00:27.045" end="00:28.758">overthink</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.078" end="00:33.517"><span begin="00:29.078" end="00:29.333">My </span><span begin="00:29.333" end="00:29.917">mind </span><span begin="00:29.917" end="00:30.317">takes </span><span begin="00:30.533" end="00:31.038">me </span><span begin="00:31.253" end="00:32.109">over </span><span begin="00:32.373" end="00:32.710">the </span><span begin="00:32.989" end="00:33.517">brink</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.837" end="00:39.814"><span begin="00:33.837" end="00:34.117">We </span><span begin="00:34.117" end="00:34.477">built </span><span begin="00:34.661" end="00:35.086">a </span><span begin="00:35.317" end="00:35.958">home </span><span begin="00:36.165" end="00:36.477">don't </span><span begin="00:36.477" end="00:36.958">let </span><span begin="00:37.158" end="00:37.453">it </span><span begin="00:37.646" end="00:39.814">sink</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.926" end="00:49.518"><span begin="00:42.926" end="00:43.878">Hold </span><span begin="00:43.878" end="00:44.742">me </span><span begin="00:44.933" end="00:45.765">close </span><span begin="00:46.118" end="00:46.486">when </span><span begin="00:46.486" end="00:46.901">my </span><span begin="00:47.190" end="00:47.598">voice </span><span begin="00:47.814" end="00:48.190">gets </span><span begin="00:48.398" end="00:49.518">shaky</span></p><p ttm